(1, '69d4cc15c45bc_1775553557.webp', 'Earn with Love – Join Our Affiliate Program!', 'Start earning high commissions by promoting our matrimonial platform.', 'How It Works', 'Discover the powerful advantages of joining our affiliate program and start earning today.', 'Sign up', 'Join our affiliate program for free in just a few clicks.', 'Promote', 'Share your unique affiliate link on social media, websites, or blogs.', 'Earn', 'Earn commissions for every successful match or registration.', 'Why Partner with Us?', 'Get started with our simple three-step process and begin earning commissions today.', 'Sign up', 'Create your free affiliate account in minutes. No setup fees or hidden costs.', 'Get Your Links', 'Access your unique affiliate links and marketing materials from your dashboard.', 'Start Earning', 'Share your links and earn commissions for every successful referral you make.', '24/7', 'Support Available', '30%', 'Commission Rate', '$0', 'Minimum Payout', '48h', 'Payment Processing', 'Why <span class=\"primary-color-n\">Affiliates</span> Trust Us', 'Get started with our simple three-step process and begin earning commissions today.', '10M+', 'Happy Families', '$1M+', 'Paid to Affiliates', '95%', 'Affiliate Satisfaction', '69d4cd8176438_1775553921.webp', 'Features', 'Powerful tools and features designed to maximize your affiliate success and earnings.', 'Real-Time Analytics', 'Track your performance with detailed analytics and insights to optimize your campaigns.', 'High Commissions', 'Earn up to 30% commission on every successful referral with competitive rates.', 'Custom Links', 'Generate personalized affiliate links with advanced tracking and attribution.', 'Instant Payouts', 'Get paid quickly with multiple payment options and no minimum thresholds.', '24/7 Support', 'Get help whenever you need it with our dedicated affiliate support team.', 'Marketing Tools', 'Access banners, email templates, and promotional materials to boost conversions.', NULL, NULL, 'en', NULL, 'APPROVED', '2025-01-24 12:29:10', '2025-01-24 12:29:10', NULL);
